        "title": "Environmental Commitment",
        "level": 2,
        "location": {
          "line": 1
        },
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 3,
              "heading": "Environmental Commitment"
            },
            "text": "At Velvera, sustainability is not an afterthought — it's part of our design philosophy. From ethical sourcing to green logistics, every step is optimized to minimize environmental impact without compromising performance or innovation."
          }
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "Sustainability Initiatives",
            "level": 3,
            "location": {
              "line": 7,
              "heading": "Environmental Commitment"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 9,
                  "heading": "Sustainability Initiatives"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Carbon Neutral Packaging\nAll Velvera packaging is made from 100% recycled paper, printed with soy-based inks, and manufactured in carbon-neutral facilities.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "** Plastic-Free Experience**\nZero plastic across packaging — including tapes, wraps, and trays. Instead, we use biodegradable fiber-based cushioning and compostable seals.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "** Trade-In & Recycling Program**\nRecycle your old Velvera or any brand’s device responsibly through our TakeBack+ program.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Instant trade-in value at velvera.com/trade-in (https://velvera.com/trade-in)",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Certified e-waste recycling partners",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Earn up to ₹1,500 in green credits",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Energy Efficiency\nAll Velvera chargers and power adapters exceed 90% energy efficiency standards and are designed to minimize phantom power drain.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Conflict-Free Materials\nAll key components (tantalum, tin, tungsten, and gold) are sourced from conflict-free and ethically audited supply chains.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Eco-Friendly Accessories\nAccessories like phone cases and watch bands made from bio-polymer, plant-based leather, and recycled ocean plastic.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
